{
  "set": "pad-let-go",
  "description": "Your voice cut into 16 pads, then TAPPED eight times. The axis is what a tap does when you let go: STOPS (the shipped gate) vs PLAYS ON (one-shot). Identical notes at identical moments in the first two \u2014 the only difference is the switch. The third shows what the gate is for.",
